; The EXT connector, on the left edge beside the screen and above the volume
; wheel.
;
; +Z points OUT of the shell, the convention every port in the room follows, so
; this one is turned a quarter turn about Y to look along -X: R_y(-90), written
; as its ROWS. It is the transpose of the Game Boy's, whose socket is on the
; other edge. 1 mm proud of the panel: a seated link plug's origin is the front
; face of its shell, and that face stops almost flush against the socket's rim.
[node name="LinkPort" parent="." instance=ExtResource("9_linkport")]
transform = Transform3D(0, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0, -0.04, 0, -0.036)
